flowchart TB
  I[Invocation]

  subgraph Parent[부모 Pi 프로세스]
    direction TB
    F[permit 이전: immutable fork source<br/>headerless bytes + manifest]
    G[permit 이전: immutable child registration<br/>surface/run binding]
    S[process-local scheduler]
    TP[private durable tree permit authority<br/>nested-child hard cap]
    W[permit 이후: child-private writable session]
    BS[permit 이후: private bootstrap artifact]
    PF[permit 이후: launch topology preflight<br/>generation-bound read-only evidence]
    LA[lifecycle socket server<br/>hint receiver]
    ST[descriptor-bound child-session JSONL tail<br/>signature index + serialized drain]
    U[incremental aggregate UI / parent result<br/>Pi core render batching]
    R[startup reaper coordinator<br/>lock / claim / quiesce]
    CM[cmux control-v2 client<br/>exact backend authority]
    TM[gated tmux -C client<br/>exact backend authority]
  end

  subgraph Broker[detached broker 프로세스]
    B[allocation-first broker]
    BB[독립 cmux request connection]
    BT[독립 tmux control client]
  end

  subgraph Child[child Pi 프로세스]
    C[child bridge와 child-session JSONL writer]
    LC[lifecycle socket client<br/>hint channel]
  end

  subgraph Backend[exact backend]
    X[cmux desktop app<br/>control socket v2]
    T[tmux server<br/>textual control mode]
  end

  D[durable artifacts<br/>allocation / lease / CompletionRecordV3]

  I --> F --> G --> S --> TP
  TP -->|permit granted| W --> BS --> PF --> B -->|gate 뒤 child start| C
  B --> BB -->|exact RPC| X
  B --> BT -->|exact RPC| T
  C --> LC -->|hint only| LA
  C -->|child-session JSONL만 기록| ST -->|incremental result| U
  B -->|allocation 먼저 publish| D
  C -->|completion publish| D
  R -->|durable evidence 검증| D
  CM -->|exact RPC| X
  TM -->|exact snapshot/action| T

  classDef durable stroke-width:3px
  classDef hint stroke-dasharray: 5 5
  class TP,R,CM,TM,D durable
